# 1.4.11: a voice's Gen page (its button again, from its layer's page): KIND, BRIGHT, MOTION, VARY; EDIT a new voice
# of the kind (par30 OWN; pat0_145 G). Generator settings are staged until EDIT.
# REC varies the current patch; SEL held undoes the last action.
wait 300
tap ENV
wait 100
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 27
expect par30 0
turn K1 1 10
wait 100
expect par30 0
turn K1 -1 10
wait 100
expect par30 0
tap EDIT
wait 100
expect par30 1
expect pat0_145 71
expect pat0_149 80
shot gen.png
turn K2 -5 10
wait 100
expect par30 1
turn K1 1 10
wait 100
expect pat0_149 80
tap EDIT
wait 100
expect pat0_149 71
tap REC
wait 100
expect par30 1
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
wait 100
expect pat0_149 71
wav gen.wav
wait 4000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
